meta {
  name: 01 List students
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/students?page=1&pageSize=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 20
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Run `Center Auth / 03 Login` first — this needs a live `accessToken`.

  Empty on a fresh center. Come back after `02 Provision student`.

  Checks worth doing by hand:

  - no Authorization header -> 401
  - a STUDENT access token  -> 401
  - `pageSize=5000`         -> 400. The cap is 100, so one request cannot pull
    an entire roster and a dashboard refresh cannot become an unbounded query.

  The response must never contain a password hash, an activation key hash or a
  reset token. The view is built field by field rather than spread from the row,
  so a column added later cannot leak here. Confirm that still holds.
}
